meta {
  name: Dashboard summary
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/dashboard/summary
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~from: 2026-11-01
  ~to: 2026-11-07
}

headers {
  ~X-Act-On-Tenant: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isDefined
}

docs {
  `GET /v1/dashboard/summary`

  Dashboard blocks; any signed-in person may call, each block is included only if the caller holds its capability. Default period is the last seven days (Bangkok days).

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `200`; `data` has `period`, `users`, `trips`, `activity`, `incidents`, `drivers`
  - **Query `from`**: Start day yyyy-MM-dd (inclusive)
  - **Query `to`**: End day yyyy-MM-dd (inclusive)
  - **Header `X-Act-On-Tenant`**: Platform staff only: act on this tenant (uuid) or * for all tenants (read-only).
}
